          .proof
            %h6#proof_5 Proof
            %p
              We need to show that the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+functors+in+homological+algebra"} derived functors
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi R
                      %mo •
