                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} R^{\bullet} Hom_{\Gamma}(N,-)
              vanish in positive degree on all co-free comodules, hence on
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi Γ
