              is trivially a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/projective+module"} projective module
              over itself, prop.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CoFreeHopfComodulesAreHomNAcyclicForProjectiveN"}
              now implies that the above is an
